---
title: Figure 3.7 — Diagramme de séquence — Création mission et paiement FCFA
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant FE as Web / Mobile<br/>create-mission
    participant API as Django REST
    participant Rules as category_rules
    participant KYC as KYCService
    participant Pay as PaymentService
    participant MM as Mobile Money
    participant ESC as EscrowService
    participant MetaMask as MetaMask
    participant SC as EscrowContract
    participant Notif as NotificationService

    Note over Client,Notif: Création adaptative + financement

    Client->>FE: Choisit catégorie mission
    FE->>API: GET schéma / règles catégorie
    API->>Rules: champs, deposit_mode, deposit_reason
    Rules-->>API: schema + estimation caution
    API-->>FE: Formulaire adapté + aperçu caution
    Client->>FE: Remplit champs demandés<br/>(adresses, marchandise, custom…)

    FE->>KYC: Vérifier KYC / email
    KYC-->>FE: OK
    FE->>API: POST /api/missions/
    API-->>FE: Mission pending + Payment

    Client->>FE: Paiement Orange / Moov
    FE->>API: initiate + confirm OTP
    API->>Pay: escrow FCFA
    Pay->>MM: paiement sandbox/prod
    MM-->>API: confirmé
    API->>ESC: lock_escrow_funds
    API->>Notif: payment_completed

    opt Ancrage blockchain optionnel
        Client->>FE: MetaMask Sepolia
        FE->>MetaMask: createMission(hash, deadline)
        MetaMask->>SC: tx on-chain
        FE->>API: POST .../blockchain/record-mission/
    end

    API-->>FE: status=funded
    FE-->>Client: Mission publiée

    Note over Client,Notif: Affectation prestataire

    alt Candidature ouverte
        actor Prestataire
        Prestataire->>FE: Consulte missions proches
        Prestataire->>API: POST .../apply/
        Client->>API: accept_application
    else Sollicitation directe
        Client->>API: POST sollicitation prestataire
        Prestataire->>API: accept / reject
    end

    API->>ESC: deposit_deadline = now+4h
    API-->>FE: status=accepted
    API->>Notif: application_accepted

    Note over Client,Notif: Caution + auto-start

    Prestataire->>FE: Dépose caution
    FE->>API: POST .../deposit/ ou pay_deposit
    API->>ESC: lock_provider_deposit
    opt Ancrage caution
        FE->>MetaMask: acceptMission
        FE->>API: record-provider-deposit
    end
    API->>API: auto-start → in_progress
    API-->>FE: status=in_progress
    FE-->>Prestataire: Mission démarrée
